WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.545 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:45.865 --> 01:48.465
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

5
01:49.065 --> 01:52.305
JIEDE

6
01:56.185 --> 01:57.305
Wait.

7
01:58.265 --> 02:00.265
His Lordship will have peace resting in the Study,

8
02:00.345 --> 02:02.425
but why the rush?

9
02:02.505 --> 02:05.145
He's only just married. And you didn't try to stop him?

10
02:05.225 --> 02:07.105
Governess, how would I dare?

11
02:11.585 --> 02:13.345
Go. Take good care of His Lordship.

12
02:13.425 --> 02:14.505
Yes.

13
02:17.545 --> 02:20.745
Madam, things have gone on since midnight.

14
02:20.825 --> 02:22.065
You must be tired.

15
02:22.785 --> 02:24.745
The Dowager Lady has excused you from today's morning greeting.

16
02:24.825 --> 02:26.985
I'll look after the Study.

17
02:27.065 --> 02:29.065
Don't worry about a thing.

18
02:29.145 --> 02:31.305
Go back to your room, Madam. A nap won't hurt.

19
02:32.265 --> 02:33.825
Please thank the Dowager Lady for her kindness.

20
02:33.905 --> 02:35.185
Governess Miao, please go about your work.

21
02:35.265 --> 02:37.825
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

22
02:40.345 --> 02:41.585
Governess Miao…

23
02:51.585 --> 02:54.105
Bitao, the old me…

24
02:54.625 --> 02:56.585
BLISS

25
02:56.665 --> 02:57.825
I mean,

26
02:58.745 --> 03:01.745
did Lord Lu and I ever have a feud?

27
03:02.265 --> 03:05.265
I need to go see Madam. Don't let anyone know. Understood?

28
03:05.345 --> 03:07.465
I understand. Don't worry, Governess.

29
03:09.585 --> 03:12.625
Governess Miao, in such a hurry so early,

30
03:12.705 --> 03:14.905
-where are you off to? -Governess Miao…

31
03:14.985 --> 03:15.945
GEJIN, MAID OF THE EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

32
03:16.025 --> 03:18.505
Governess Wu sent me.

33
03:21.025 --> 03:24.225
Well, Dowager Lady is always worried about His Lordship's illness.

34
03:24.305 --> 03:26.225
Heaven had mercy.

35
03:26.305 --> 03:28.905
As soon as the Young Lady married in, the marriage really did cure him.

36
03:29.745 --> 03:33.265
I thought I'd hurry to the Wei Residence with the good news.

37
03:33.345 --> 03:34.945
Do you have an exit pass?

38
03:37.825 --> 03:39.585
The Duchess gave orders long ago

39
03:40.185 --> 03:41.745
that His Lordship has just woken from a serious illness

40
03:41.825 --> 03:43.465
and needs quiet rest.

41
03:43.545 --> 03:45.625
Songyue Hall is to be closed for now.

42
03:45.705 --> 03:47.545
Not just outsiders,

43
03:47.625 --> 03:50.105
even the masters of the second, third, and fourth branches,

44
03:50.185 --> 03:53.185
and His Lordship's cousins, may not visit.

45
03:53.265 --> 03:56.185
So nothing disturbs his recovery.

46
03:56.265 --> 03:58.625
The Duke's Residence has its rules.

47
03:59.185 --> 04:00.825
Without the master's order,

48
04:00.905 --> 04:03.385
female servants of the inner household may not pass messages outside.

49
04:03.985 --> 04:06.545
Governess Wu, keep this in mind,

50
04:07.545 --> 04:09.065
so you don't break the rules later

51
04:09.665 --> 04:11.905
and make things hard for Madam.

52
04:13.705 --> 04:15.345
It was careless of me.

53
04:16.184 --> 04:17.624
Thank you for the reminder, Governess Miao.

54
04:18.585 --> 04:21.265
I must go to the Tea Room to check on Madam's bean porridge.

55
04:23.185 --> 04:24.785
The one who should've died didn't,

56
04:24.865 --> 04:26.945
-and I can't get word out either. -Why are you still standing here?

57
04:27.025 --> 04:29.225
-What should I do? -You're dismissed. Go.

58
04:29.305 --> 04:31.305
You're saying she pushed Lady Xie?

59
04:32.185 --> 04:33.025
No.

60
04:34.705 --> 04:36.705
I pushed Lady Xie in,

61
04:37.345 --> 04:39.225
and Lord Lu saw it all.

62
04:41.705 --> 04:42.905
Then could it be

63
04:44.505 --> 04:46.185
that Lady Xie

64
04:46.705 --> 04:48.585
is the woman Lord Lu loves?

65
04:50.465 --> 04:53.385
No wonder he looked at me like he wanted to eat me alive.

66
04:56.025 --> 04:58.345
Then this feud runs really deep.

67
05:00.305 --> 05:02.265
If he really drives me out,

68
05:02.345 --> 05:04.425
rumors will hurt the Wei family,

69
05:04.505 --> 05:06.665
and those people will never let me go.

70
05:07.185 --> 05:09.945
If others fail, at worst they just part ways.

71
05:10.025 --> 05:13.105
If I fail, I'll be sent to the chopping block.

72
05:13.185 --> 05:16.665
No. Staying in the Duke's Residence is my only way to survive.

73
05:22.905 --> 05:24.545
I didn't dare ask before,

74
05:25.345 --> 05:26.665
but did the scar on your face

75
05:27.505 --> 05:28.865
happen back then?

76
05:30.865 --> 05:31.745
It's nothing.

77
05:32.865 --> 05:36.305
Now, His Lordship holds this grudge against you.

78
05:37.945 --> 05:40.105
You must be very careful.

79
05:41.745 --> 05:43.065
Thank you for the heads-up.

80
05:44.745 --> 05:46.145
I know what to do.

81
05:48.665 --> 05:50.865
SHIZHAI

82
05:52.425 --> 05:53.425
My Lord,

83
05:58.385 --> 05:59.345
it's time for your medicine.

84
06:01.345 --> 06:02.465
Go away.

85
06:06.865 --> 06:09.985
Serving a husband his medicinal decoction is a wife's duty.

86
06:10.825 --> 06:12.585
However much you despise me,

87
06:13.745 --> 06:15.025
I must still do my duty.

88
06:16.185 --> 06:17.985
You were only vicious before.

89
06:19.185 --> 06:21.785
Now you're a hypocrite too.

90
06:21.865 --> 06:24.665
Spare me your sweet talk and your act.

91
06:24.745 --> 06:25.625
Tell me the truth.

92
06:28.385 --> 06:30.145
You agreed to a bridal marriage to ward off my illness.

93
06:31.385 --> 06:34.065
-What are you really after? -I…

94
06:40.225 --> 06:41.985
That's easy for you to say, My Lord.

95
06:44.145 --> 06:46.145
You're a hero admired by all,

96
06:46.905 --> 06:49.705
and the Duchess got an Imperial Edict from the Empress Dowager for this marriage.

97
06:50.505 --> 06:52.025
If I openly broke it off,

98
06:52.105 --> 06:55.705
the Wei family would be defying the edict and breaking faith.

99
06:55.785 --> 06:57.865
My family would be condemned.

100
06:57.945 --> 06:59.545
I had no choice,

101
07:00.865 --> 07:02.585
but now that I've married you,

102
07:03.385 --> 07:04.425
I am your wife.

103
07:05.865 --> 07:07.385
My Lord, please be generous.

104
07:07.465 --> 07:09.825
Since I married you to ward off your illness,

105
07:10.785 --> 07:12.985
-let's not dwell on the past… -Don't even think about it.

106
07:13.585 --> 07:15.305
I will never take

107
07:15.385 --> 07:19.025
an arrogant and ruthless woman with a viper's heart as my wife.

108
07:19.985 --> 07:21.665
You are even less worthy of being the Lu family's principal wife.

109
07:22.705 --> 07:23.865
Grandmother forced this marriage,

110
07:24.665 --> 07:26.265
so you may keep the betrothal gifts.

111
07:26.825 --> 07:28.105
In three days,

112
07:28.625 --> 07:29.745
go and take your leave of Grandmother.

113
07:32.785 --> 07:35.065
Tell her we're not of one mind and can't be husband and wife.

114
07:36.185 --> 07:38.225
Pack and leave my family.

115
07:39.425 --> 07:41.105
As for all the evil things you did before,

116
07:42.105 --> 07:43.345
I'll never speak of them.

117
07:45.625 --> 07:47.185
If you refuse,

118
07:48.025 --> 07:51.585
I'll tell the elders myself and have you thrown out.

119
07:52.545 --> 07:56.025
When you lose all dignity then,

120
07:56.985 --> 07:58.825
you'll have only yourself to blame.

121
08:01.545 --> 08:03.945
You're very ill, My Lord. Please take your medicine first.

122
08:04.025 --> 08:05.185
Don't touch me.

123
08:07.825 --> 08:09.025
It's all scalded red.

124
08:18.745 --> 08:21.385
What a heartless man.

125
08:21.465 --> 08:23.305
Begging him won't help.

126
08:30.265 --> 08:32.904
Physician Zhao is coming to change His Lordship's dressing.

127
08:34.144 --> 08:35.345
I'll take my leave.

128
08:47.505 --> 08:48.505
My Lord,

129
08:49.385 --> 08:51.345
I watched you grow up.

130
08:51.945 --> 08:54.825
In the past, even when servants made mistakes,

131
08:54.905 --> 08:57.145
you'd forgive them.

132
08:57.745 --> 08:59.545
Your new bride has just married in

133
08:59.625 --> 09:02.025
and hasn't done anything seriously wrong.

134
09:02.105 --> 09:05.865
Why are you so harsh with her?

135
09:07.425 --> 09:08.345
Governess,

136
09:09.065 --> 09:10.625
people are foolish.

137
09:11.145 --> 09:12.705
They judge by looks.

138
09:14.265 --> 09:16.185
Charmed by beauty, they trust the wicked.

139
09:17.025 --> 09:19.625
Some people have only beautiful skin,

140
09:20.785 --> 09:22.345
but their hearts are vicious,

141
09:23.145 --> 09:24.905
cruel, and twisted.

142
09:24.985 --> 09:26.865
They treat human life as nothing.

143
09:27.825 --> 09:30.145
Such people are scarier than ghosts.

144
09:30.745 --> 09:32.545
Even if she were as lovely as a fairy,

145
09:33.665 --> 09:35.185
she would still make me shudder.

146
09:37.225 --> 09:39.025
Never mind sharing a bed,

147
09:40.985 --> 09:42.625
even sharing a room with her

148
09:45.265 --> 09:46.945
is more than I can bear.

149
10:00.745 --> 10:03.185
Are these not to your taste, My Lady?

150
10:03.825 --> 10:06.025
I'll have them taken away and remade.

151
10:07.105 --> 10:08.465
You know me.

152
10:09.105 --> 10:10.025
Look at all this.

153
10:10.825 --> 10:14.505
Roasted meat, steamed dish, cured chicken and dried venison…

154
10:15.745 --> 10:16.945
And this Sliced…

155
10:18.025 --> 10:19.785
Sliced Fish with Golden Relish.

156
10:24.705 --> 10:27.465
At home, we couldn't even afford pastries.

157
10:28.145 --> 10:30.185
When I first ate meat at the Wei Residence,

158
10:30.265 --> 10:31.705
I had vomiting and diarrhea all night.

159
10:32.385 --> 10:35.825
I must be born poor, unable to enjoy such things.

160
10:37.105 --> 10:39.985
Have some wheat meal today, My Lady.

161
10:40.065 --> 10:43.185
Later, add some minced fish and get used to it slowly.

162
10:49.225 --> 10:51.225
You asked Physician Zhao for medicine

163
10:51.305 --> 10:54.225
to heal the scars on your hands…

164
10:55.625 --> 10:58.425
My Lady, what are you doing? I don't deserve this.

165
11:00.865 --> 11:02.145
I asked Governess Miao

166
11:02.225 --> 11:04.145
to get it from Physician Zhao.

167
11:04.665 --> 11:06.945
It's Jade Beauty Powder that fades scars.

168
11:07.505 --> 11:10.905
It's a little late to use it now. I hope it still works.

169
11:16.785 --> 11:18.825
Thank you, My Lady.

170
11:25.945 --> 11:26.985
My Lady,

171
11:28.265 --> 11:29.945
I heard you've lost your appetite,

172
11:30.025 --> 11:34.225
so I had the kitchen make some light bean porridge and flatbread.

173
11:34.305 --> 11:35.225
Please try some.

174
11:36.025 --> 11:37.305
That's thoughtful of you, Governess.

175
11:52.865 --> 11:53.945
Is there something else, Governess?

176
11:55.985 --> 11:58.145
Since His Lordship moved out,

177
11:58.225 --> 12:00.025
everyone in Songyue Hall is talking.

178
12:00.825 --> 12:03.505
They say he's unhappy with this marriage

179
12:03.585 --> 12:05.705
and dislikes his new bride.

180
12:06.705 --> 12:07.665
Well…

181
12:08.465 --> 12:09.345
As I see it,

182
12:09.985 --> 12:12.225
you need to find a way to fix this

183
12:12.305 --> 12:15.105
and win His Lordship over.

184
12:16.145 --> 12:18.385
Do you have a good idea, Governess?

185
12:18.465 --> 12:19.385
As is the custom,

186
12:19.985 --> 12:22.905
the Old Madam will introduce you to the Lu family relatives.

187
12:23.425 --> 12:25.945
A new bride must present gifts to her elders.

188
12:26.665 --> 12:29.265
Why not use this chance to make some embroidered goods

189
12:29.945 --> 12:32.465
to please the Old Madam and Mother?

190
12:33.025 --> 12:35.705
With the elders on your side,

191
12:35.785 --> 12:38.385
His Lordship can't go against filial duty.

192
12:39.225 --> 12:40.585
Embroidered goods?

193
12:42.385 --> 12:44.745
I'm no expert at embroidery,

194
12:45.985 --> 12:47.345
but I often did it at home.

195
12:48.145 --> 12:50.025
That's perfect.

196
12:50.105 --> 12:52.305
To secure your place in the Duke's Residence,

197
12:52.385 --> 12:55.305
you must work hard, My Lady.

198
12:56.305 --> 12:57.345
Thank you for the advice, Governess.

199
12:58.065 --> 12:59.305
You're welcome, My Lady.

200
13:00.585 --> 13:02.865
The bean porridge is getting cold. Eat it while it's warm.

201
13:40.465 --> 13:41.745
Go to sleep.

202
13:42.265 --> 13:43.785
Remember to apply the medicine first.

203
13:44.465 --> 13:46.345
It needs to be mixed with water.

204
13:47.065 --> 13:49.745
The kitchen will bring cow's milk tomorrow morning.

205
13:49.825 --> 13:51.265
It is better mixing it with milk.

206
13:52.785 --> 13:55.905
It's already the second watch. Please get some rest, My Lady.

207
13:56.505 --> 13:57.865
Don't worry about me.

208
13:58.425 --> 14:00.225
I'm used to working late at home.

209
14:00.305 --> 14:01.985
I can't do fine crafts,

210
14:02.505 --> 14:04.105
but my embroidery is good enough to show.

211
14:06.225 --> 14:07.465
My Lady,

212
14:07.545 --> 14:09.465
when a lady from a family like the Wei Residence marries,

213
14:09.545 --> 14:11.945
not just the gifts for relatives,

214
14:12.025 --> 14:13.825
even the embroidered rewards for servants

215
14:13.905 --> 14:15.625
are made by the household embroiderers over three years

216
14:15.705 --> 14:16.585
and prepared well in advance.

217
14:16.665 --> 14:19.505
Why would you do it yourself?

218
14:20.585 --> 14:23.745
-Governess Wu clearly… -I see.

219
14:24.825 --> 14:26.425
She's taking advantage of my ignorance,

220
14:27.105 --> 14:28.825
playing tricks to wear me out.

221
14:30.825 --> 14:32.785
I won't obey her in everything,

222
14:33.905 --> 14:35.905
so she wants me to make a fool of myself in public.

223
14:35.985 --> 14:37.665
Thank you for telling me.

224
14:38.745 --> 14:40.065
Go to sleep.

225
14:44.345 --> 14:45.745
Are you still going to embroider, My Lady?

226
14:45.825 --> 14:46.705
Yes.

227
14:47.305 --> 14:50.385
If you really can't sleep, why not tell me

228
14:50.905 --> 14:53.825
what the Wei Residence sent as my dowry?

229
14:58.785 --> 15:01.265
When a lady from a family like the Wei Residence marries,

230
15:01.345 --> 15:03.785
the dowry is always prepared well in advance…

231
15:35.425 --> 15:36.545
Grandmother.

232
15:37.185 --> 15:38.905
Rao, you're here.

233
15:40.545 --> 15:43.585
You've already met the Dowager Lady and your mother-in-law.

234
15:44.545 --> 15:46.345
This is your Second Aunt.

235
15:46.425 --> 15:48.545
ZHUO CHENGJUN, SECOND DAUGHTER-IN-LAW OF THE DUKE OF YING

236
15:49.505 --> 15:50.345
Greetings, Second Aunt.

237
15:50.425 --> 15:51.545
Greetings.

238
15:52.585 --> 15:55.545
Come. Let me take a good look at you.

239
16:02.265 --> 16:06.465
Mother, let me be honest, and don't be cross.

240
16:07.505 --> 16:11.785
Everyone says the two Young Ladies of our family are the finest,

241
16:12.385 --> 16:15.505
but today, after seeing His Lordship's new bride,

242
16:15.585 --> 16:20.145
I finally know there's always someone better.

243
16:20.825 --> 16:23.025
Such a beautiful and outstanding young lady

244
16:23.105 --> 16:27.385
makes the ladies of our family look plain by comparison.

245
16:27.985 --> 16:28.905
Well.

246
16:28.985 --> 16:31.225
I love hearing that.

247
16:31.305 --> 16:34.465
Look at Rao. Not only is she beautiful,

248
16:34.545 --> 16:37.865
but she's also blessed with the best fortune in the world.

249
16:38.545 --> 16:43.305
This lucky girl is one I risked my pride to snatch for us.

250
16:44.265 --> 16:45.465
Yes.

251
16:47.625 --> 16:49.225
Indeed.

252
16:49.305 --> 16:51.585
Old Madam is very strict.

253
16:51.665 --> 16:54.065
Look how she treasured this delicate granddaughter,

254
16:54.145 --> 16:57.305
afraid she'd melt in her mouth or be lost from her arms.

255
16:57.905 --> 17:01.345
She never showed up at ordinary tea gatherings or flower banquets.

256
17:01.425 --> 17:03.065
Thanks to your good eye, Mother,

257
17:03.145 --> 17:05.105
you arranged this match for His Lordship early

258
17:05.184 --> 17:07.865
and brought this lovely flower into our home.

259
17:09.505 --> 17:11.105
This is your Third Aunt.

260
17:12.184 --> 17:13.025
Third Aunt.

261
17:13.625 --> 17:15.665
REN YUZHEN, THIRD DAUGHTER-IN-LAW OF THE DUKE OF YING

262
17:15.745 --> 17:18.145
Good timing. Come and greet your sisters-in-law.

263
17:18.224 --> 17:19.065
Come.

264
17:21.985 --> 17:25.625
This is Changning, and this is Changhui. They're your younger cousins.

265
17:28.184 --> 17:29.145
Rao.

266
17:29.225 --> 17:30.305
LU CHANGHUI, DAUGHTER OF THE THIRD BRANCH, DUKE OF YING'S RESIDENCE

267
17:30.385 --> 17:31.465
LU CHANGNING, DAUGHTER OF THE SECOND BRANCH, DUKE OF YING'S RESIDENCE

268
17:32.225 --> 17:33.065
Greetings, cousins.

269
17:33.905 --> 17:36.705
This is your cousin and my niece, Weiyu.

270
17:37.305 --> 17:39.625
HE WEIYU, NIECE OF HE WANNIANG

271
17:39.705 --> 17:41.985
-Rao. -Weiyu.

272
17:45.145 --> 17:46.345
Bitao.

273
17:46.425 --> 17:49.025
CLOUDS DRIFT, RAIN NOURISHES

274
17:51.705 --> 17:54.105
The gift prepared at home was too dull in color.

275
17:54.185 --> 17:58.025
I feared you might not like it, so I made a new one myself.

276
17:58.105 --> 18:00.225
I hope you like it.

277
18:09.385 --> 18:10.385
Dowager Lady,

278
18:10.465 --> 18:12.865
Madam called Guanzhu and Yinyu over

279
18:13.465 --> 18:16.865
to ask about your favorite colors and patterns.

280
18:16.945 --> 18:19.585
At the third watch, Bitao was still changing the candles.

281
18:19.665 --> 18:23.225
She stayed up two nights and put her heart into it.

282
18:24.985 --> 18:27.665
You made this for me yourself.

283
18:27.745 --> 18:30.625
Wearing it, I can feel your devotion.

284
18:30.705 --> 18:32.545
How could I not like it?

285
18:33.065 --> 18:34.625
You're too kind, Grandmother.

286
18:34.705 --> 18:37.825
Even my rough needlework finds favor in your eyes.

287
18:38.345 --> 18:41.425
Back home, Grandmother always said I was clumsy.

288
18:41.505 --> 18:45.305
Giving my embroidery to elders might embarrass me before a noble family.

289
18:46.145 --> 18:48.185
So we had embroiderers from Jiguang Pavilion

290
18:48.265 --> 18:51.425
to make better gifts for all the elders and my younger cousins.

291
18:53.465 --> 18:54.905
-Governess Wu, -Yes?

292
19:00.265 --> 19:01.505
why are you standing there?

293
19:01.585 --> 19:04.425
I had you count them out last night.

294
19:04.945 --> 19:08.585
I sewed those pearl-adorned silver-trimmed shoes myself

295
19:08.665 --> 19:10.225
for Mother.

296
19:13.265 --> 19:16.545
Second Aunt, you're so elegant and radiant.

297
19:17.425 --> 19:20.465
The gold-inlaid cloud-and-bird embroidered apron suits you perfectly.

298
19:20.545 --> 19:21.705
How thoughtful.

299
19:21.785 --> 19:24.985
And a gold-flower purple silk outer garment

300
19:25.505 --> 19:29.105
that matches your outfit today, Third Aunt.

301
19:29.625 --> 19:30.985
I have one, too?

302
19:33.265 --> 19:35.225
Fourth Aunt, you have refined taste.

303
19:35.825 --> 19:38.265
I have a bedside incense burner with wheels on its four feet.

304
19:38.345 --> 19:39.905
It's finely made.

305
19:39.985 --> 19:42.105
-You'll surely love it. -Thank you.

306
19:42.705 --> 19:44.025
There's also a jade box

307
19:44.105 --> 19:45.785
full of ornamental hairpins and dangling hair ornaments.

308
19:45.865 --> 19:46.825
Bring that too.

309
19:47.425 --> 19:50.905
Grandmother chose them carefully for me to give to my cousins.

310
20:03.505 --> 20:06.505
Did you hear? The Dowager Lady wants to see them.

311
20:07.185 --> 20:10.105
Don't keep her waiting. Hurry.

312
20:12.665 --> 20:15.785
Yes, I'll bring them right away.

313
20:21.625 --> 20:23.545
The three days are almost up.

314
20:23.625 --> 20:25.345
I got past Grandmother,

315
20:25.425 --> 20:27.345
but how do I deal with Lu Zhuo?

316
20:29.025 --> 20:32.785
Heavens, you should've taken him back then too.

317
20:32.865 --> 20:34.505
Being a rich widow

318
20:35.025 --> 20:36.905
beats being thrown out.

319
20:37.985 --> 20:39.105
Young Master.

320
20:39.625 --> 20:41.905
Slow down, Fifth Young Master!

321
20:43.105 --> 20:45.345
LU CHE, SECOND SON OF THE THIRD BRANCH, DUKE OF YING'S RESIDENCE

322
20:45.945 --> 20:46.745
Fifth Young Master.

323
20:47.785 --> 20:49.985
Young Master, please come down.

324
20:50.745 --> 20:52.345
Be careful, Young Master!

325
20:55.305 --> 20:56.305
-Fifth Young Master. -My Lady.

326
20:56.385 --> 20:57.385
-Fifth Young Master. -My Lady.

327
20:57.465 --> 21:00.985
-My Lady. -Where did he get hurt? Wake up.

328
21:01.625 --> 21:02.545
Fifth Young Master.

329
21:02.625 --> 21:03.985
My Lady, are you hurt?

330
21:04.065 --> 21:06.065
Fifth Young Master, wake up.

331
21:06.145 --> 21:07.545
Which branch do you serve?

332
21:07.625 --> 21:11.225
How could you let a child climb so high? Stop crying and get help.

333
21:12.505 --> 21:13.385
Yes.

334
21:16.905 --> 21:18.105
A fall can be minor or serious.

335
21:19.065 --> 21:21.785
Since we saw it, we can't ignore it.

336
21:22.505 --> 21:25.665
Governess Wu, Bitao is young and doesn't know much.

337
21:25.745 --> 21:28.105
Please go and fetch Governess Miao yourself.

338
21:28.185 --> 21:29.425
And the Physician too, if possible.

339
21:30.385 --> 21:32.625
-Well… -Please.

340
21:34.665 --> 21:35.745
Noted.

341
21:46.505 --> 21:48.545
My Lord, time for your medicine.

342
21:52.305 --> 21:53.145
Help me up.

343
21:53.225 --> 21:54.185
Yes.

344
22:08.025 --> 22:09.225
What happened?

345
22:10.185 --> 22:11.745
The Dowager Lady and Third Madam have come to see Madam.

346
22:11.825 --> 22:13.385
They're talking inside.

347
22:14.185 --> 22:15.465
She hasn't moved out yet?

348
22:22.585 --> 22:23.745
Help me up.

349
22:23.825 --> 22:25.265
Physician Zhao said you mustn't move.

350
22:25.865 --> 22:26.745
Why are you…

351
22:31.345 --> 22:32.825
Careful, My Lord.

352
22:39.825 --> 22:42.425
This boy has always been naughty and reckless,

353
22:42.505 --> 22:44.465
running around like a headless fly.

354
22:44.545 --> 22:47.865
Luckily you caught him in time.

355
22:47.945 --> 22:49.505
If he'd landed on his head,

356
22:49.585 --> 22:51.825
even if he weren't crippled,

357
22:52.345 --> 22:53.785
he'd have ended up a fool.

358
22:53.865 --> 22:55.785
Che told me later

359
22:56.305 --> 22:58.785
that Zhuo made that kite for him.

360
22:59.945 --> 23:02.065
He just cherishes his brother.

361
23:02.145 --> 23:04.945
He meant well. Please don't blame him.

362
23:05.025 --> 23:06.105
Okay.

363
23:06.185 --> 23:07.585
Good girl.

364
23:08.105 --> 23:10.745
You look pale, and your voice sounds off.

365
23:10.825 --> 23:12.745
Let's call the Physician.

366
23:16.465 --> 23:19.425
It's just a sprain. Nothing serious.

367
23:20.385 --> 23:23.105
Forgive me for causing you worry. I've failed in my filial duty.

368
23:25.665 --> 23:26.905
You have indeed.

369
23:29.945 --> 23:32.865
Zhuo, why are you out of bed?

370
23:35.785 --> 23:37.665
How do you look after him?

371
23:37.745 --> 23:40.185
He's so sick that a breeze could knock him over,

372
23:40.265 --> 23:43.185
and you let him wander around? Do you want a caning?

373
23:43.265 --> 23:46.665
-Forgive me, Dowager Lady. I… -Don't blame him.

374
23:47.265 --> 23:48.345
I ordered it.

375
23:50.265 --> 23:52.025
My wife is hurt.

376
23:52.905 --> 23:54.025
As her husband,

377
23:55.025 --> 23:56.585
how could I not visit her?

378
24:09.665 --> 24:11.985
I heard you got hurt saving Che.

379
24:13.625 --> 24:15.185
Where are you hurt?

380
24:17.105 --> 24:18.385
Just a sprained right arm.

381
24:18.985 --> 24:21.305
Go ask Physician Zhao to examine her.

382
24:22.585 --> 24:24.465
It's a small injury. A few days' rest will do.

383
24:27.785 --> 24:29.825
No need to call a doctor and make a fuss.

384
24:29.905 --> 24:32.025
Physician Zhao has sharp eyes.

385
24:32.865 --> 24:35.825
How you were hurt, where, and when it will heal,

386
24:36.865 --> 24:37.905
he'll know them at a glance.

387
24:38.865 --> 24:40.425
If you keep refusing,

388
24:41.345 --> 24:44.545
it must be that your injury is feigned.

389
24:46.505 --> 24:49.865
Feigned? What nonsense is that?

390
24:52.185 --> 24:54.585
Grandmother, you're always kind and upright,

391
24:55.465 --> 24:56.505
so of course you don't know that some people

392
24:56.585 --> 24:58.465
have honeyed words but evil hearts.

393
24:58.545 --> 24:59.545
They lie all the time,

394
25:00.425 --> 25:01.865
are cunning by nature,

395
25:01.945 --> 25:04.145
and never change, however often they're warned.

396
25:06.745 --> 25:07.785
In that case,

397
25:09.625 --> 25:10.945
thank you, My Lord.

398
25:11.025 --> 25:12.585
Please send for Physician Zhao.

399
25:13.345 --> 25:14.185
Yes.

400
25:45.705 --> 25:46.665
How is it?

401
25:47.865 --> 25:50.945
This is outrageous.

402
25:51.025 --> 25:54.025
The bone is injured, yet you act like nothing's wrong.

403
25:54.105 --> 25:55.785
If it isn't set now,

404
25:55.865 --> 25:58.425
-you'll lose this arm. -What?

405
25:59.065 --> 26:01.025
She has a bone injury?

406
26:01.545 --> 26:04.185
But she seemed fine just now.

407
26:04.705 --> 26:07.425
How strange. The shoulder is dislocated,

408
26:09.225 --> 26:12.585
and the elbow and wrist are both sprained.

409
26:13.105 --> 26:16.945
Even a strong man would scream in pain.

410
26:17.545 --> 26:19.945
I know your family are military men,

411
26:20.025 --> 26:23.145
but are you, the new bride, made of iron too,

412
26:23.985 --> 26:25.745
not saying a word about the pain?

413
26:25.825 --> 26:27.585
Rao,

414
26:27.665 --> 26:30.345
this is the pain of dislocated bones and torn tendons.

415
26:30.425 --> 26:31.985
Why did you keep quiet?

416
26:32.825 --> 26:36.865
How can a delicate girl like you bear this?

417
26:38.025 --> 26:41.225
I've only been married three days.

418
26:41.305 --> 26:42.945
If I already need the Physician,

419
26:43.545 --> 26:45.865
and my grandmother and uncle hear of it,

420
26:46.385 --> 26:48.505
they'll think the Lu family mistreats me.

421
26:49.185 --> 26:52.305
It would cause bad feelings between our families for no reason.

422
26:53.225 --> 26:55.905
And others would gossip.

423
26:56.945 --> 27:00.505
Grandmother, you're kind and treat me so well.

424
27:00.585 --> 27:02.625
You kept His Lordship's waking a secret.

425
27:02.705 --> 27:04.385
You must have had good reason.

426
27:05.145 --> 27:07.465
I didn't want to make a fuss.

427
27:08.985 --> 27:13.105
I thought I could bear it. I didn't know the bone was hurt.

428
27:14.345 --> 27:15.785
But don't worry, Grandmother.

429
27:16.385 --> 27:19.785
I'm young. I can bear a little pain.

430
27:24.825 --> 27:28.145
VIRTUE IN FRAGRANCE

431
27:28.225 --> 27:29.985
Are you happy now?

432
27:30.665 --> 27:34.465
She's your wife, not your enemy on the battlefield.

433
27:34.545 --> 27:37.305
She's so kind, dutiful and gentle.

434
27:37.385 --> 27:39.665
How could you wrong her?

435
27:39.745 --> 27:42.105
I think your illness has muddled your mind.

436
27:43.785 --> 27:46.665
Physician Zhao, my granddaughter-in-law's injury

437
27:46.745 --> 27:48.545
is in your hands.

438
27:48.625 --> 27:51.865
Don't worry, Old Madam. For serious injuries,

439
27:51.945 --> 27:53.265
the bone must be pulled and set first.

440
27:54.345 --> 27:55.705
It'll hurt. Bear with it.

441
27:56.505 --> 27:59.025
You two, come and hold her down firmly.

442
28:01.265 --> 28:02.705
Hold her steady.

443
28:02.785 --> 28:06.225
When I pull, she mustn't move at all.

444
28:21.345 --> 28:23.345
It'll be quick. Hold on.

445
28:36.425 --> 28:38.665
This splinting method is common in the army.

446
28:38.745 --> 28:40.465
My Lord, you know it too.

447
28:40.545 --> 28:43.785
Soak the cedar bark in cold water for four hours.

448
28:44.385 --> 28:46.305
When binding it, leave the joints free.

449
28:46.385 --> 28:49.705
-Wrist, elbow… -Wrap them in silk gauze.

450
28:51.025 --> 28:53.705
Please keep an eye on it, My Lord.

451
28:55.505 --> 28:56.345
I will.

452
28:58.505 --> 28:59.425
See Physician Zhao out.

453
29:29.345 --> 29:32.465
Dowager Lady, the Physician has left.

454
29:37.385 --> 29:39.505
How did Rao offend you

455
29:40.025 --> 29:43.625
that you suspect her at every turn, shut her out, and bully her?

456
29:44.225 --> 29:46.865
She's a noble young lady in the prime of youth

457
29:46.945 --> 29:49.585
who willingly married in to ward off your illness.

458
29:49.665 --> 29:52.185
And you treat her so cruelly?

459
29:52.985 --> 29:54.985
Aren't you afraid of being struck by lightning?

460
29:55.825 --> 29:58.745
Grandmother, marrying to ward off illness is nonsense.

461
29:58.825 --> 29:59.825
-I… -Well, well.

462
30:00.425 --> 30:03.105
Now you can breathe and talk,

463
30:03.625 --> 30:04.705
and all you do is run your mouth accusing people.

464
30:05.625 --> 30:08.105
You're so tough and great.

465
30:08.185 --> 30:10.545
When you lay in bed like the living dead, have you forgotten all that?

466
30:11.465 --> 30:15.545
Back then I prayed to the deities every day.

467
30:15.625 --> 30:18.025
Wei Rao is the lucky star I threw away my pride

468
30:18.105 --> 30:20.625
and principles to win over.

469
30:20.705 --> 30:24.185
You may not believe it, but I do. Everyone believes it.

470
30:24.265 --> 30:26.465
If you treat Rao even a little badly,

471
30:26.545 --> 30:29.865
you're heartless and ungrateful,

472
30:29.945 --> 30:32.185
worse than a dog or pig.

473
30:32.265 --> 30:34.185
Heaven will punish you.

474
30:34.705 --> 30:38.185
Once Heaven turns against you and takes your fortune and your life,

475
30:38.265 --> 30:41.385
it will break my heart.

476
30:44.625 --> 30:45.585
Grandmother.

477
30:46.625 --> 30:48.785
-I have my reasons. -I won't listen.

478
30:49.385 --> 30:50.225
Go back

479
30:51.185 --> 30:52.065
and apologize to Rao.

480
30:52.905 --> 30:55.865
Otherwise, don't ever call me Grandmother again.

481
31:12.465 --> 31:13.505
I'll be gentler.

482
31:29.185 --> 31:30.145
Does it hurt?

483
31:44.825 --> 31:46.105
His Lordship is here.

484
32:03.425 --> 32:05.225
My Lord, what are your orders?

485
32:06.225 --> 32:07.305
All of you, leave.

486
32:28.665 --> 32:30.305
If you want to send me away,

487
32:31.025 --> 32:32.945
wait until my injury heals.

488
32:33.705 --> 32:37.185
If I leave injured, it may harm your name.

489
32:38.065 --> 32:41.385
And Grandmother would never allow it.

490
33:05.025 --> 33:07.905
I wronged you today. Forgive me.

491
33:13.705 --> 33:15.145
Thank you for saving Che.

492
33:23.225 --> 33:25.705
You refuse to be my husband

493
33:26.225 --> 33:27.265
only because back then

494
33:28.105 --> 33:30.585
I made a terrible mistake out of jealousy.

495
33:31.625 --> 33:34.705
Your disgust for me is understandable.

496
33:35.625 --> 33:37.305
A forced match is never sweet.

497
33:38.105 --> 33:39.865
I don't want to force you either.

498
33:40.905 --> 33:42.985
But our marriage was granted by the Empress Dowager.

499
33:43.705 --> 33:45.465
To divorce after only three days,

500
33:46.065 --> 33:48.905
first, would disrespect the Imperial Family

501
33:49.505 --> 33:50.705
and offend the nobles.

502
33:51.305 --> 33:55.465
Second, it would invite gossip and hurt both families' good names.

503
33:56.225 --> 33:59.545
People who don't know would say I lack virtue

504
33:59.625 --> 34:00.905
and was thrown out by your family.

505
34:00.985 --> 34:03.505
How could Wei's daughters marry after that?

506
34:04.425 --> 34:05.625
Third…

507
34:10.105 --> 34:11.264
Third,

508
34:12.585 --> 34:14.225
everyone hopes we'll be

509
34:15.905 --> 34:17.225
a happy couple.

510
34:18.225 --> 34:20.385
Going against the elders' wishes

511
34:21.425 --> 34:22.625
also goes against filial duty.

512
34:33.425 --> 34:34.744
I can't be your husband.

513
34:41.025 --> 34:44.425
Then please bear with it for a while, My Lord.

514
34:44.945 --> 34:47.425
When the time is right, we'll talk about divorce by agreement.

515
34:48.025 --> 34:49.225
How long?

516
34:49.304 --> 34:50.585
-Three years. -One year.

517
34:53.985 --> 34:54.824
Alright.

518
34:56.225 --> 34:57.145
One year it is.

519
34:58.025 --> 34:59.225
But in front of others,

520
35:00.185 --> 35:01.545
please

521
35:02.865 --> 35:04.345
let me keep my dignity.

522
35:04.865 --> 35:06.145
Don't be rude like today.

523
35:12.465 --> 35:14.265
We'll be husband and wife in name only.

524
35:14.865 --> 35:17.705
A loving couple in public, separate rooms in private.

525
35:17.785 --> 35:20.945
No beating servants, no killing the innocent.

526
35:21.025 --> 35:22.385
Do your duty as the principal wife.

527
35:23.705 --> 35:26.745
In front of others, I'll give you all due honor and respect.

528
35:26.825 --> 35:29.865
After one year, we'll divorce by mutual agreement

529
35:30.465 --> 35:31.585
and go our separate ways.

530
35:32.105 --> 35:34.305
Whoever we marry, we'll have nothing to do with each other.

531
35:37.345 --> 35:40.225
Let's clap hands on it, My Lord.

532
35:40.825 --> 35:43.945
-If one day… -If anyone breaks this oath,

533
35:44.705 --> 35:46.225
they'll be struck by lightning, burned by fire,

534
35:46.745 --> 35:48.345
and cut by swords.

535
36:15.145 --> 36:16.665
Change the cedar bark every three days.

536
36:17.345 --> 36:18.185
Get some rest.

537
36:43.105 --> 36:44.025
My Lady,

538
36:44.585 --> 36:47.145
why be so hard on yourself?

539
36:48.105 --> 36:49.585
How could you do that to yourself?

540
36:59.145 --> 37:00.265
My Lady, you…

541
37:03.065 --> 37:04.905
When I had nowhere to turn,

542
37:06.585 --> 37:08.385
letting me save that child

543
37:11.465 --> 37:13.625
was Heaven giving me a chance.

544
37:15.585 --> 37:17.505
Compared to the chopping block,

545
37:18.385 --> 37:19.625
what's this bit of pain?

546
37:21.105 --> 37:22.905
I want to live.

547
37:25.705 --> 37:28.425
Even if I have to struggle along in shame,

548
37:32.185 --> 37:33.905
I just want to live.

549
37:38.185 --> 37:40.065
I made a medicinal pillow for His Lordship.

550
37:41.025 --> 37:41.985
Take it to him for me.

551
37:49.945 --> 37:53.025
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

552
37:53.105 --> 37:55.145
My Lord, Madam sent you a medicinal pillow.

553
37:55.225 --> 37:56.385
I've put it on for you.

554
37:56.465 --> 37:59.305
Where's today's court gazette? Why hasn't it come yet?

555
38:00.225 --> 38:02.945
Governess Miao kept all the court gazettes I brought.

556
38:03.585 --> 38:04.425
Forget the gazettes.

557
38:05.345 --> 38:07.585
The Dowager Lady won't even let General Qi in.

558
38:08.305 --> 38:11.145
You forced yourself out of bed yesterday, and your wound opened up.

559
38:11.225 --> 38:12.745
If you keep neglecting your health,

560
38:13.345 --> 38:14.945
Governess Miao will tell the Dowager Lady

561
38:15.025 --> 38:17.585
and have all of us dragged out for forty strokes.

562
38:17.665 --> 38:20.385
Please take pity on us and just rest.

563
38:22.145 --> 38:23.265
Go.

564
38:23.785 --> 38:24.945
-Time to eat. -Well…

565
38:38.585 --> 38:40.265
Who said you could eat here?

566
38:41.545 --> 38:43.345
You're resting in the Study,

567
38:44.105 --> 38:45.585
and as your wife,

568
38:46.145 --> 38:47.585
I should be here to serve you.

569
38:47.665 --> 38:50.265
Otherwise, if the elders ask,

570
38:50.785 --> 38:52.505
what would I tell them?

571
38:54.945 --> 38:56.185
Oh, Wei Rao.

572
38:56.825 --> 38:58.945
You've only got one working arm,

573
39:01.305 --> 39:02.545
and you're still scheming.

574
39:03.665 --> 39:05.705
What did you call me, My Lord?

575
39:10.105 --> 39:13.225
You got hurt saving Che. Who would dare blame you?

576
39:15.745 --> 39:18.025
You're overthinking it,

577
39:20.105 --> 39:21.345
Rao.

578
39:24.585 --> 39:26.505
You're so considerate, My Lord.

579
39:26.585 --> 39:28.545
How could I slack off?

580
39:29.865 --> 39:32.185
Eating with you is a small gesture.

581
39:32.905 --> 39:34.345
It shows we're a loving couple

582
39:35.225 --> 39:37.025
so the elders won't worry.

583
39:58.785 --> 40:00.305
Look at your face.

584
40:00.385 --> 40:03.305
Anyone would think I'd poisoned your bowl.

585
40:06.025 --> 40:07.385
Forgive my rudeness.

586
40:16.145 --> 40:18.785
I have no appetite while sick. I'm done.

587
40:20.305 --> 40:21.265
Don't trouble yourself, Rao.

588
40:22.225 --> 40:23.505
Go and heal first,

589
40:25.145 --> 40:26.305
then come look after me.

590
40:27.505 --> 40:30.705
Thank you for your care. I'm so grateful.

591
40:53.065 --> 40:54.225
What's wrong, Madam?

592
40:54.945 --> 40:57.465
Nothing. Maybe I didn't sleep well last night.

593
40:58.065 --> 40:59.225
YINYU, MAID OF THE DUKE OF YING'S RESIDENCE

594
40:59.305 --> 41:01.025
Why isn't Bitao here this morning?

595
41:02.665 --> 41:04.265
And where are Gejin and Chilan?

596
41:04.785 --> 41:08.185
Madam, Bitao, Gejin, and Chilan

597
41:08.265 --> 41:09.385
were all called away by Governess Wu.

598
41:11.985 --> 41:15.105
You told her about the dowry inventory and shamed me in front of everyone.

599
41:15.185 --> 41:17.905
-That's for your loose tongues! -I really didn't tell her.

600
41:17.985 --> 41:21.305
What do I know about gold or jade? Please spare me, Governess.

601
41:21.385 --> 41:23.185
That's still you gossiping!

602
41:23.265 --> 41:26.105
Don't hit them. I'm the one in charge of the room.

603
41:26.185 --> 41:28.345
When Her Ladyship asked, we just answered her.

604
41:28.425 --> 41:30.105
We didn't mean to cross you, Governess.

605
41:31.585 --> 41:34.225
Governess, stop. If Her Ladyship finds out, it'll be bad.

606
41:34.305 --> 41:35.945
I've served the Madam for decades

607
41:36.545 --> 41:38.465
and trained countless maids.

608
41:39.105 --> 41:41.025
Even the masters show me some respect.

609
41:41.105 --> 41:43.265
How dare you talk back!

610
41:43.345 --> 41:45.865
-Talk back, will you? -I'll beat you to death!

611
41:45.945 --> 41:47.745
What are you doing? If I can't beat you to death…

612
41:50.625 --> 41:51.465
My Lady, you're here.

613
41:52.425 --> 41:53.345
You don't know.

614
41:54.105 --> 41:56.225
All the valuable dowry items and the dowry inventory

615
41:56.305 --> 41:58.825
were supposed to be checked by them and put into storage.

616
41:58.905 --> 42:01.545
But they were all lazy and careless.

617
42:01.625 --> 42:04.025
They packed away the embroidered goods and jewelry

618
42:04.105 --> 42:04.945
meant as greeting gifts too.

619
42:06.145 --> 42:09.025
I'm old, and my memory is poor.

620
42:09.105 --> 42:10.545
They didn't remind me,

621
42:11.145 --> 42:13.665
so you went to all that trouble for nothing.

622
42:13.745 --> 42:15.505
You nearly lost face before the Lu family.

623
42:15.585 --> 42:18.065
-They must be punished. -How dare you!

624
42:19.305 --> 42:20.265
Did you ask me?

625
42:20.865 --> 42:22.185
This is the Duke's Residence.

626
42:22.705 --> 42:24.425
Beating their faces black and blue

627
42:24.505 --> 42:26.065
only makes people think we have no manners.

628
42:27.105 --> 42:28.505
Bitao, go put some medicine on.

629
42:34.665 --> 42:37.945
As you say, My Lady. When have I ever disobeyed?

630
42:38.025 --> 42:40.505
Fine, I won't punish them.

631
42:41.025 --> 42:43.865
But since you married into the Duke's Residence,

632
42:44.505 --> 42:46.305
His Lordship's illness

633
42:46.385 --> 42:48.105
made you miss the return to the bride's family on the third day.

634
42:48.905 --> 42:50.705
The Wei masters worry day and night,

635
42:51.305 --> 42:53.385
hoping you'll visit home soon.

636
42:57.065 --> 42:59.905
His Lordship is ill, and so am I.

637
43:00.505 --> 43:01.945
If I go back now,

638
43:02.025 --> 43:04.465
should the Wei elders see His Lordship sick,

639
43:04.545 --> 43:06.545
or me with a broken bone who can't even hold chopsticks?

640
43:13.945 --> 43:15.505
The Wei Residence is so strange.

641
43:15.585 --> 43:17.225
They beat maids harder than thieves.

642
43:20.345 --> 43:22.265
A bunch of thieving maids.

643
43:22.345 --> 43:24.545
Shameless wretches.

644
43:24.625 --> 43:26.665
Think you're the masters now?

645
43:27.945 --> 43:31.865
Once we're back at the Wei Residence, you'll get what's coming.

646
43:37.305 --> 43:40.705
-Cui, is the lotus seed soup ready? -Almost.

647
43:41.665 --> 43:45.025
Governess Wu said she lost a ring in the garden and sent me to find it.

648
43:45.105 --> 43:47.025
She's minding the fire for me.

649
43:47.785 --> 43:49.225
Alright, go.

650
44:10.425 --> 44:12.465
Meddling poor wench.

651
44:12.545 --> 44:13.985
What a lowlife.

652
44:15.425 --> 44:17.305
You only deserve my spit.

653
44:29.505 --> 44:32.505
Eat it. Eat it.

654
44:55.745 --> 44:58.585
I'm just a stupid fool.

655
44:58.665 --> 45:00.145
Getting angry with me

656
45:00.745 --> 45:04.345
is no different from getting angry with an animal.

657
45:05.265 --> 45:08.265
I apologize to you again.

658
45:09.665 --> 45:11.985
Of all the people from the Wei Residence,

659
45:12.585 --> 45:14.945
only you and Bitao know who I really am.

660
45:15.985 --> 45:17.665
I don't blame you for your rudeness,

661
45:18.265 --> 45:20.385
but we're both in the Lu family now.

662
45:21.105 --> 45:22.585
We should stick together.

663
45:23.745 --> 45:25.145
If you keep making trouble

664
45:26.025 --> 45:27.785
and the boat sinks,

665
45:27.865 --> 45:29.145
we'll be charged with deceiving the Emperor.

666
45:29.865 --> 45:31.225
Who would gain from that?

667
45:31.825 --> 45:35.185
Yes. You're generous and forgiving, My Lady.

668
45:35.265 --> 45:37.145
I'll change completely.

669
45:43.385 --> 45:48.585
The Old Madam of the Duke's Residence heard you can't eat or sleep well

670
45:48.665 --> 45:50.585
and sent this specially.

671
45:50.665 --> 45:52.265
It's made with red dates and lotus seeds.

672
45:52.345 --> 45:54.305
It's light, tasty and calms the mind.

673
45:54.385 --> 45:56.745
Why not have some more?

674
46:11.865 --> 46:14.705
No wonder you've had no appetite and no strength.

675
46:15.385 --> 46:17.025
You have a fever.

676
46:17.865 --> 46:18.745
My head hurts badly too.

677
46:20.225 --> 46:23.025
Go fetch Governess Miao. Tell her…

678
46:23.105 --> 46:25.425
My Lady, a sudden high fever is bad.

679
46:26.185 --> 46:28.985
Could it be a chill stirring up a hidden illness?

680
46:29.065 --> 46:31.065
This must be spring fever.

681
46:32.145 --> 46:35.705
My Lady, the Duke's Residence cares a lot about custom.

682
46:35.785 --> 46:38.305
You, as a new bride, are falling ill right after marrying in.

683
46:38.385 --> 46:40.065
If you stay here to recover,

684
46:40.145 --> 46:42.105
you'll bring disaster to the Lu family.

685
46:42.865 --> 46:46.105
You must go back to your own family and return once you're well.

686
46:48.745 --> 46:52.265
My Lady, drink more of this lotus seed soup.

687
46:52.345 --> 46:53.185
You'll get better faster.

688
47:00.625 --> 47:03.945
Don't listen to her, My Lady. This woman wants to kill you.

689
47:06.145 --> 47:07.505
Let go!

690
47:08.825 --> 47:12.585
My Lady, I saw she put something in the lotus seed soup.

691
47:12.665 --> 47:14.545
I'm afraid even the bean porridge you eat every day

692
47:14.625 --> 47:15.625
has been tampered with.

693
47:17.385 --> 47:19.025
You heartless little wench.

694
47:19.105 --> 47:20.505
You're framing me!

695
47:20.585 --> 47:23.265
No wonder she has been finding fault with me all day.

696
47:23.345 --> 47:25.665
So you've been stirring things up.

697
47:26.225 --> 47:28.585
I'll tear your mouth apart. I…

698
47:28.665 --> 47:30.065
-Stop. -I'll beat you to death.

699
47:30.145 --> 47:34.545
The First Madam sent me here, and you dare falsely accuse me, huh?

700
47:34.625 --> 47:36.745
-Open your eyes and see clearly. -Stop!

701
47:37.345 --> 47:39.865
Know your place, high or low!

702
47:39.945 --> 47:41.585
-Bitao. -Let me tell you,

703
47:41.665 --> 47:43.985
a bald turtledove will never be a phoenix. You…

704
47:44.505 --> 47:47.025
Think about where you come from.

705
47:47.625 --> 47:50.425
To be the servant of a servant like me, you're not even worthy!

706
47:51.465 --> 47:54.505
-You brat. You dare frame me. -Bitao.

707
47:55.265 --> 47:57.905
I'll beat you to death. Beat you to death!

708
48:05.425 --> 48:07.785
My Lady… My Lady.

709
48:11.705 --> 48:15.425
Very well. You impostor.

710
48:15.505 --> 48:19.425
You're pushing me too far. Let's go to His Lordship and settle this.

711
48:20.105 --> 48:24.105
We'll see if he still wants a lowborn wife like you.

712
48:26.105 --> 48:27.665
I'll smash you to death!

713
49:03.225 --> 49:04.065
She…

714
49:06.185 --> 49:07.025
She's dead.

715
49:11.385 --> 49:12.425
Dead?

716
49:18.505 --> 49:19.705
My Lady…

717
49:21.505 --> 49:22.545
I…

718
49:23.345 --> 49:25.105
I killed someone.

719
49:36.265 --> 49:37.105
Who's there?

720
49:50.425 --> 49:52.465
I caught her tampering with the lotus seed soup.

721
49:53.465 --> 49:55.665
I thought she was just trying to make you suffer, My Lady.

722
49:59.825 --> 50:03.705
I wanted her to taste her own medicine and pay for it.

723
50:03.785 --> 50:06.625
I never thought she'd…

724
50:07.745 --> 50:09.745
She wanted me to catch spring fever

725
50:10.265 --> 50:12.305
so the Lu family would fear it

726
50:12.385 --> 50:15.105
and send me back to my family,

727
50:15.625 --> 50:17.425
making it easier for them to act later.

728
50:18.025 --> 50:19.025
This drug

729
50:20.545 --> 50:22.065
wasn't just added today.

730
50:23.185 --> 50:25.505
I must have shamed her in public.

731
50:25.585 --> 50:26.985
She held a grudge,

732
50:28.065 --> 50:29.425
so she used too much.

733
50:30.425 --> 50:33.025
Then I…

734
50:33.705 --> 50:35.185
She plotted to hurt others

735
50:35.745 --> 50:37.025
and lost her own life.

736
50:37.625 --> 50:38.905
It's not your fault.

737
50:40.105 --> 50:43.265
I should thank you for saving my life.

738
50:46.625 --> 50:49.185
My Lady, you've only been married a few days,

739
50:49.265 --> 50:50.745
and your dowry attendant is already dead.

740
50:50.825 --> 50:55.025
People who don't know the truth may blame you for her death.

741
50:55.105 --> 50:56.665
What do we do now?

742
51:00.505 --> 51:03.505
-My Lady… -Madam, His Lordship is here.

743
53:16.425 --> 53:19.105
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
